 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-11","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.56","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.56/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"4474cde4bd8180d0de80e1e8c61e3f4a011cd5ac161cdaaa14a0aa574b1b5322"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.56/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"7fcbc21358d670133dcf096410393fa3401d89a7b765eb0b67d3ebb5f4ac7187"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.56/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"ca46c22727cd376fe9288cbf7a63ab0dbc2905b59bf12c427029e4fabd624773"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.56/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"c13d37f08a39a3b6d1cfe1e45deb452d4233c28a3170a7140a1ed3e7f5daf6dd"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.56"}